Notebook[{

Cell["\<\
Bispectrum monopole (\[ScriptL]=0) Gaussian covariance

Derives the explicit expression for the angular integral in Eq. (B.3) of
Ivanov, Simonovic, Zaldarriaga (JCAP 2020) [arXiv:1907.06666]:

  C^{B,\[ScriptL]=0}_{TT'} = (2\[Pi])^3/V(z) \[Times] \[Pi] s_{123}/(dk1 dk2 dk3) \
\[Times] \[Delta]_{TT'}/(k1 k2 k3) \[Times] I(k1,k2,k3)

where I(k1,k2,k3) = 1/(4\[Pi]) \[Integral] d\[Phi] d\[Omega] sin\[Omega] \
\[Product]_{a=1}^{3} [P_g(k_a,\[Mu]_a) + 1/nbar]

The coordinate system follows Scoccimarro, Couchman, Frieman (ApJ 1999) \
[arXiv:astro-ph/9808305], as derived in Bispectrum_mu2_derivation.nb.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958e9, 3.958e9}}],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ",
   RowBox[{"Legendre", " ", "polynomial"}], " ", "*)"}],
  "\[IndentingNewLine]",
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"L", "[",
      RowBox[{"ell_", ",", "mu_"}], "]"}], ":=",
     RowBox[{"LegendreP", "[",
      RowBox[{"ell", ",", "mu"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]",
   "\[IndentingNewLine]",
   RowBox[{"(*", " ",
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Direction", " ", "cosines", " ",
      RowBox[{"w", ".", "r", ".", "t", "."}], " ", "the", " ", "line", " ",
      "of", " ",
      RowBox[{"sight", ".", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[Omega]"}]}], ":", " ",
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"polar", " ", "angle", " ", "between", " ", "k1", " ", "and",
        " ",
        RowBox[{"LOS", ".", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[Phi]"}]}], ":", " ",
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"azimuthal", " ", "angle", " ", "of", " ", "k2", " ",
          "around", " ",
          RowBox[{"k1", ".", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[Theta]12"}]}], ":",
         " ",
         RowBox[{"angle", " ", "between", " ", "k1", " ", "and", " ",
          "k2"}]}], ",", " ",
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Theta]12", "]"}], "=",
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(",
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"k3", "^", "2"}], "-",
             RowBox[{"k1", "^", "2"}], "-",
             RowBox[{"k2", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}], "/",
           RowBox[{"(",
            RowBox[{"2", " ", "k1", " ", "k2"}], ")"}]}]}], ".",
         "\[IndentingNewLine]",
         RowBox[{"\[Theta]13", ":", " ",
          RowBox[{"angle", " ", "between", " ", "k1", " ", "and", " ",
           "k3"}]}]}]}]}], ",", " ",
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Theta]13", "]"}], "=",
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(",
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"k2", "^", "2"}], "-",
           RowBox[{"k1", "^", "2"}], "-",
           RowBox[{"k3", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}], "/",
         RowBox[{"(",
          RowBox[{"2", " ", "k1", " ", "k3"}], ")"}]}]}], ".",
       "\[IndentingNewLine]",
       RowBox[{"Sine", " ",
        RowBox[{"rule", ":", " ",
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"k2", " ",
           RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]12", "]"}]}], "=",
          RowBox[{"k3", " ",
           RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]13", "]"}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}], " ",
    "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]",
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"mu1", "=",
     RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Omega]", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]",
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"mu2", "=",
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Omega]", "]"}], " ",
       RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Theta]12", "]"}]}], "-",
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Phi]", "]"}], " ",
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Omega]", "]"}], " ",
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]12", "]"}]}]}]}], ";"}],
   "\[IndentingNewLine]",
   RowBox[{"(*", " ",
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"mu3", " ", "via", " ", "triangle", " ",
      RowBox[{"closure", ":", " ",
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"k1", "+", "k2", "+", "k3"}], "=", "0"}]}]}], ",", " ",
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"giving", " ", "mu3"}], "=",
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-",
         RowBox[{"(",
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"k1", " ", "mu1"}], "+",
           RowBox[{"k2", " ", "mu2"}]}], ")"}]}], "/", "k3"}]}], ".",
      "\[IndentingNewLine]",
      RowBox[{"Using", " ", "the", " ", "sine", " ", "rule", " ", "this",
       " ", "simplifies", " ",
       RowBox[{"to", ":"}]}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]",
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"mu3", "=",
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Omega]", "]"}], " ",
       RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Theta]13", "]"}]}], "+",
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Phi]", "]"}], " ",
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Omega]", "]"}], " ",
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]13", "]"}]}]}]}], ";"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958e9, 3.958e9}}],

Cell["\<\
Verify that the mu3 expression is consistent with the triangle closure \
condition mu3 = -(k1 mu1 + k2 mu2)/k3 under the substitution \
Cos[\[Theta]13] = -(k1 + k2 Cos[\[Theta]12])/k3 and \
Sin[\[Theta]13] = k2 Sin[\[Theta]12]/k3 (sine rule).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958e9, 3.958e9}}],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"mu3Direct", "=",
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"-",
     RowBox[{"(",
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"k1", " ", "mu1"}], "+",
       RowBox[{"k2", " ", "mu2"}]}], ")"}]}], "/", "k3"}]}], ";"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"mu3Sub", "=",
   RowBox[{"mu3", "/.",
    RowBox[{"{",
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Theta]13", "]"}], "\[Rule]",
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-",
         RowBox[{"(",
          RowBox[{"k1", "+",
           RowBox[{"k2", " ",
            RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Theta]12", "]"}]}]}], ")"}]}], "/",
        "k3"}]}], ",",
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]13", "]"}], "\[Rule]",
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"k2", " ",
         RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]12", "]"}]}], "/", "k3"}]}]}],
     "}"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[",
  RowBox[{"mu3Direct", "-", "mu3Sub"}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958e9, 3.958e9}}],

Cell["\<\
Define the D coefficients: angular-averaged products of Legendre polynomials.

D_{l1,l2,l3}(\[Theta]12,\[Theta]13) = 1/(4\[Pi]) \[Integral]_0^{2\[Pi]} \
d\[Phi] \[Integral]_0^{\[Pi]} d\[Omega] sin\[Omega] \
L_{l1}(\[Mu]1) L_{l2}(\[Mu]2) L_{l3}(\[Mu]3)

The full angular integral decomposes as:
I(k1,k2,k3) = \[CapitalSigma]_{l1,l2,l3} D_{l1,l2,l3} \
Pt_{l1}(k1) Pt_{l2}(k2) Pt_{l3}(k3)

where Pt_0(k) = P_0(k) + 1/nbar absorbs the shot noise, and \
Pt_2 = P_2, Pt_4 = P_4.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958e9, 3.958e9}}],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ells", "=",
   RowBox[{"{",
    RowBox[{"0", ",", "2", ",", "4"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"DCoeff", "[",
    RowBox[{"l1_", ",", "l2_", ",", "l3_"}], "]"}], ":=",
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"DCoeff", "[",
     RowBox[{"l1", ",", "l2", ",", "l3"}], "]"}], "=",
    RowBox[{"Module", "[",
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{",
       RowBox[{"integrand", ",", "phiResult"}], "}"}], ",",
      "\[IndentingNewLine]",
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"integrand", "=",
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"L", "[",
          RowBox[{"l1", ",", "mu1"}], "]"}], " ",
         RowBox[{"L", "[",
          RowBox[{"l2", ",", "mu2"}], "]"}], " ",
         RowBox[{"L", "[",
          RowBox[{"l3", ",", "mu3"}], "]"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
       RowBox[{"phiResult", "=",
        RowBox[{"Integrate", "[",
         RowBox[{"integrand", ",",
          RowBox[{"{",
           RowBox[{"\[Phi]", ",", "0", ",",
            RowBox[{"2", " ", "Pi"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
       "\[IndentingNewLine]",
       RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[",
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          FractionBox["1",
           RowBox[{"4", " ", "Pi"}]], " ",
          RowBox[{"Integrate", "[",
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"phiResult", " ",
             RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Omega]", "]"}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"{",
             RowBox[{"\[Omega]", ",", "0", ",", "Pi"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}],
         ",",
         RowBox[{"Assumptions", "\[Rule]",
          RowBox[{"{",
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]12", "]"}], ">", "0"}], ",",
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]13", "]"}], ">", "0"}]}],
           "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\n",
 RowBox[{"(*", " ",
  RowBox[{"Compute", " ", "and", " ", "display", " ", "non", "-",
   RowBox[{"zero", " ", "D", " ", "coefficients"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"DResults", "=",
   RowBox[{"Flatten", "[",
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Table", "[",
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{",
        RowBox[{"l1", ",", "l2", ",", "l3", ",",
         RowBox[{"DCoeff", "[",
          RowBox[{"l1", ",", "l2", ",", "l3"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
       RowBox[{"{",
        RowBox[{"l1", ",", "ells"}], "}"}], ",",
       RowBox[{"{",
        RowBox[{"l2", ",", "ells"}], "}"}], ",",
       RowBox[{"{",
        RowBox[{"l3", ",", "ells"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "2"}], "]"}]}],
  ";"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"nonZeroD", "=",
   RowBox[{"Select", "[",
    RowBox[{"DResults", ",",
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"#", "[",
        RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], "=!=", "0"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}],
  ";"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{"TableForm", "[",
  RowBox[{"nonZeroD", ",",
   RowBox[{"TableHeadings", "\[Rule]",
    RowBox[{"{",
     RowBox[{"None", ",",
      RowBox[{"{",
       RowBox[{
       "\"\<\[ScriptL]1\>\"", ",", "\"\<\[ScriptL]2\>\"", ",",
        "\"\<\[ScriptL]3\>\"", ",",
        "\"\<D_{\[ScriptL]1,\[ScriptL]2,\[ScriptL]3}\>\""}], "}"}]}],
     "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958e9, 3.958e9}}],

Cell["\<\
Assemble the full angular integral I(k1,k2,k3) from the D coefficients.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958e9, 3.958e9}}],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Pcoeff", "[",
    RowBox[{"0", ",", "k_"}], "]"}], ":=",
   RowBox[{"Pt0", "[", "k", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Pcoeff", "[",
    RowBox[{"2", ",", "k_"}], "]"}], ":=",
   RowBox[{"P2", "[", "k", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Pcoeff", "[",
    RowBox[{"4", ",", "k_"}], "]"}], ":=",
   RowBox[{"P4", "[", "k", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\n",
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"covIntegral", "=",
   RowBox[{"Sum", "[",
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"DCoeff", "[",
       RowBox[{"l1", ",", "l2", ",", "l3"}], "]"}], " ",
      RowBox[{"Pcoeff", "[",
       RowBox[{"l1", ",", "k1"}], "]"}], " ",
      RowBox[{"Pcoeff", "[",
       RowBox[{"l2", ",", "k2"}], "]"}], " ",
      RowBox[{"Pcoeff", "[",
       RowBox[{"l3", ",", "k3"}], "]"}]}], ",",
     RowBox[{"{",
      RowBox[{"l1", ",", "ells"}], "}"}], ",",
     RowBox[{"{",
      RowBox[{"l2", ",", "ells"}], "}"}], ",",
     RowBox[{"{",
      RowBox[{"l3", ",", "ells"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\n",
 RowBox[{"(*", " ",
  RowBox[{"Collect", " ", "by", " ", "multipole", " ", "products"}], " ",
  "*)"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"allTerms", "=",
   RowBox[{"Flatten", "[",
    RowBox[{"Outer", "[",
     RowBox[{"Times", ",",
      RowBox[{"{",
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Pt0", "[", "k1", "]"}], ",",
        RowBox[{"P2", "[", "k1", "]"}], ",",
        RowBox[{"P4", "[", "k1", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
      RowBox[{"{",
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Pt0", "[", "k2", "]"}], ",",
        RowBox[{"P2", "[", "k2", "]"}], ",",
        RowBox[{"P4", "[", "k2", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
      RowBox[{"{",
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Pt0", "[", "k3", "]"}], ",",
        RowBox[{"P2", "[", "k3", "]"}], ",",
        RowBox[{"P4", "[", "k3", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}],
 "\n",
 RowBox[{"Collect", "[",
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Expand", "[", "covIntegral", "]"}], ",", "allTerms"}],
  "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958e9, 3.958e9}}],

Cell["\<\
Express the result in terms of k1, k2, k3 using the triangle relations:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958e9, 3.958e9}}],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"triangleRules", "=",
   RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Theta]12", "]"}], "\[Rule]",
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(",
        RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox["k3", "2"], "-",
         SuperscriptBox["k1", "2"], "-",
         SuperscriptBox["k2", "2"]}], ")"}], "/",
       RowBox[{"(",
        RowBox[{"2", " ", "k1", " ", "k2"}], ")"}]}]}], ",",
     "\[IndentingNewLine]",
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox[
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]12", "]"}], "2"], "\[Rule]",
      RowBox[{"1", "-",
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"(",
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(",
           RowBox[{
            SuperscriptBox["k3", "2"], "-",
            SuperscriptBox["k1", "2"], "-",
            SuperscriptBox["k2", "2"]}], ")"}], "/",
          RowBox[{"(",
           RowBox[{"2", " ", "k1", " ", "k2"}], ")"}]}], ")"}], "2"]}]}],
     ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Theta]13", "]"}], "\[Rule]",
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(",
        RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox["k2", "2"], "-",
         SuperscriptBox["k1", "2"], "-",
         SuperscriptBox["k3", "2"]}], ")"}], "/",
       RowBox[{"(",
        RowBox[{"2", " ", "k1", " ", "k3"}], ")"}]}]}], ",",
     "\[IndentingNewLine]",
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox[
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]13", "]"}], "2"], "\[Rule]",
      RowBox[{"1", "-",
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"(",
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(",
           RowBox[{
            SuperscriptBox["k2", "2"], "-",
            SuperscriptBox["k1", "2"], "-",
            SuperscriptBox["k3", "2"]}], ")"}], "/",
          RowBox[{"(",
           RowBox[{"2", " ", "k1", " ", "k3"}], ")"}]}], ")"}], "2"]}]}]}],
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"covInK", "=",
   RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[",
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"covIntegral", "/.", "triangleRules"}], ",",
     RowBox[{"Assumptions", "\[Rule]",
      RowBox[{"{",
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"k1", ">", "0"}], ",",
        RowBox[{"k2", ">", "0"}], ",",
        RowBox[{"k3", ">", "0"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{"Collect", "[",
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Expand", "[", "covInK", "]"}], ",", "allTerms"}],
  "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958e9, 3.958e9}}],

Cell["\<\
Comparison with Eq. (4.3) and Appendix F of Ivanov et al. (Phys.Rev.D 105, \
063512) [arXiv:2110.10161], and Eq. (19-20) of Sefusatti (2015) \
[arXiv:1502.03099].

Both papers use the tree-level (Kaiser) power spectrum
P_g(k,\[Mu]) = (b1 + f \[Mu]^2)^2 P_lin(k), which gives the multipoles:
  Pt0(k) = (b1^2 + 2 b1 f/3 + f^2/5) P_lin(k) + 1/nbar
  P2(k) = (4 b1 f/3 + 4 f^2/7) P_lin(k)
  P4(k) = (8 f^2/35) P_lin(k)

We substitute these into our general expression and verify that the result \
matches the direct integration of the Kaiser model.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958e9, 3.958e9}}],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"kaiserRules", "=",
   RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Pt0", "[", "k_", "]"}], "\[RuleDelayed]",
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(",
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["b1", "2"], "+",
          FractionBox[
           RowBox[{"2", " ", "b1", " ", "f"}], "3"], "+",
          FractionBox[
           SuperscriptBox["f", "2"], "5"]}], ")"}], " ",
        RowBox[{"Plin", "[", "k", "]"}]}], "+",
       FractionBox["1", "nbar"]}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"P2", "[", "k_", "]"}], "\[RuleDelayed]",
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(",
        RowBox[{
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{"4", " ", "b1", " ", "f"}], "3"], "+",
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{"4", " ",
           SuperscriptBox["f", "2"]}], "7"]}], ")"}], " ",
       RowBox[{"Plin", "[", "k", "]"}]}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"P4", "[", "k_", "]"}], "\[RuleDelayed]",
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"8", " ",
         SuperscriptBox["f", "2"]}], "35"], " ",
       RowBox[{"Plin", "[", "k", "]"}]}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]",
    "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"covKaiser", "=",
   RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[",
    RowBox[{"covIntegral", "/.", "kaiserRules"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\n",
 RowBox[{"(*", " ",
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
   "Direct", " ", "integration", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "Kaiser", " ",
    "model", " ", "for", " ", "cross"}], "-", "check"}], " ", "*)"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"PgK", "[",
    RowBox[{"mu_", ",", "k_"}], "]"}], ":=",
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(",
       RowBox[{"b1", "+",
        RowBox[{"f", " ",
         SuperscriptBox["mu", "2"]}]}], ")"}], "2"], " ",
     RowBox[{"Plin", "[", "k", "]"}]}], "+",
    FractionBox["1", "nbar"]}]}], ";"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"intK", "=",
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Omega]", "]"}], " ",
    RowBox[{"PgK", "[",
     RowBox[{"mu1", ",", "k1"}], "]"}], " ",
    RowBox[{"PgK", "[",
     RowBox[{"mu2", ",", "k2"}], "]"}], " ",
    RowBox[{"PgK", "[",
     RowBox[{"mu3", ",", "k3"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"covDirectK", "=",
   RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[",
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1",
       RowBox[{"4", " ", "Pi"}]], " ",
      RowBox[{"Integrate", "[",
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Integrate", "[",
         RowBox[{"intK", ",",
          RowBox[{"{",
           RowBox[{"\[Phi]", ",", "0", ",",
            RowBox[{"2", " ", "Pi"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",",
        RowBox[{"{",
         RowBox[{"\[Omega]", ",", "0", ",", "Pi"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
     RowBox[{"Assumptions", "\[Rule]",
      RowBox[{"{",
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]12", "]"}], ">", "0"}], ",",
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]13", "]"}], ">", "0"}]}], "}"}]}]}],
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\n",
 RowBox[{"(*", " ",
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Verify", ":", " ", "should"}], " ", "give", " ", "0"}], " ",
  "*)"}], "\n",
 RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[",
  RowBox[{"covKaiser", "-", "covDirectK"}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958e9, 3.958e9}}],

Cell["\<\
Summary:

The Gaussian covariance of the bispectrum monopole [Eq. (B.3)] is:

  C^{B,l=0}_{TT'} = (2\[Pi])^3/V(z) \[Times] \[Pi] s_{123}/(dk1 dk2 dk3 k1 \
k2 k3) \[Times] \[Delta]_{TT'} \[Times] I(k1,k2,k3)

where s_{123} = 6, 2, 1 for equilateral, isosceles, and general triangles, \
and I(k1,k2,k3) = covIntegral is the angular integral derived above.

The result decomposes into D_{l1,l2,l3} coefficients (angular averages of \
triple Legendre polynomial products) multiplying products of power spectrum \
multipoles Pt_l1(k1) Pt_l2(k2) Pt_l3(k3).

Compare the explicit D coefficients with:
- Appendix F of Ivanov et al. (Phys.Rev.D 105, 063512) [arXiv:2110.10161]
- Eq. (19-20) of Sefusatti (2015) [arXiv:1502.03099], where the angular \
integral structure is the same after averaging over triangle orientations.\
